# vhs tape for the capx café guardrail demo — renders landing/assets/demo.gif + tools/demo/demo.mp4
# Every verdict shown is produced live by the real chokepoint code (see guardrail-demo.ts).
Output landing/assets/demo.gif
Output tools/demo/demo.mp4

Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1240
Set Height 700
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "pnpm demo"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 20s
